 tools/nas-relay/README.md        |  9 +++++++
 tools/nas-relay/qmx_nas_relay.py | 45 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 tools/tx-test/README.md          |  9 +++++++
 tools/tx-test/tx_compare.py      | 15 +++++++++++
